Fri Sep 04 18:45:00 UTC 2026 - Wozaaard! <cin.sourcer@gmail.com>

- Add a netconfig DNS backend for wicked-managed hosts.
- Select direct resolver or dnsmasq forwarder integration from
  NETCONFIG_DNS_FORWARDER and expose the effective DNS mode through D-Bus,
  amneziactl and the GNOME application.
- Select DNS integration by operational ownership, with an explicit
  DNS_BACKEND=auto|resolved|netconfig|none override.
- Persist the backend together with the selected profile so removal and
  backend changes revert the correct integration.
- Format transfer totals and handshake age in human-readable units in
  amneziactl stats.

