Thu Sep 03 23:58:00 UTC 2026 - Wozaaard! <cin.sourcer@gmail.com>

- Bump version to 0.3.0.
- Add a validating unbound resolver with strict DNS-over-TLS forwarding to
  every isolated profile.
- Add optional systemd-resolved integration with one persistent system DNS
  profile selected through D-Bus, CLI or the GNOME application.
- Split host integration into the optional amnezia-gate-resolved backend and restore
  its volatile per-link state whenever systemd-resolved starts.
- Recommend the backend conditionally when systemd-resolved is already present,
  without pulling a new resolver into systems that do not use it.
- Hide DNS controls in the GNOME application when no DNS backend is installed.
- Keep DNS integration independent of NetworkManager, wicked and networkd.

