- Bump version to 0.2.0.
- Bound automatic profile restarts to five attempts in two minutes.
- Reset the systemd start limiter on an explicit start or restart request.
- Export aggregate AWG transfer counters and latest handshake timestamps over
  D-Bus and display totals and measured rates in the GNOME application.

